@startuml
title Remote Change Processing - Normal vs On-Demand
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Existing Graph delta / remote item processing;
:Apply existing eligibility and filtering rules;
:Create/update authoritative item DB record;

if (on_demand enabled?) then (no)
  :Existing behaviour;
  :Queue content download when existing logic requires it;
  :Download / validate / materialise;
else (yes)
  if (Policy requires local content?) then (yes)
    :Queue through existing download path;
    :Download and validate;
    :Commit stable hydrated state;
  else (no)
    :Do not queue ordinary content download;
    :Commit stable cloud-only state;
    :FUSE presents item from DB metadata;
  endif
endif
stop
@enduml
